From: mscharged-port native compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve world wire records beneath original placement factories
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Prepare typed native backing for the source-selected class at its original
placement expression. Preserve constructors, Initialize, source raw strides,
parent and object counts, callbacks, flags, factory selection and ownership.
Console and non-module native projections remain byte-identical.

diff --git a/src/Game/world.cpp b/src/Game/world.cpp
